    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A xianxia inspired cultivation game where you rise from a mere mortal to an immortal cultivator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate your body, mind, and soul</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience tribulations and breakthrough realms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover and learn powerful techniques</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials, refine pills, and forge legendary equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dungeons and fortuitous encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight powerful monsters and other cultivators</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many more..!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path of immortality never ends!</p>",
